    "custom_liquid_atVrEf": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  House of Sonali — About / D2C (Custom Liquid)\n  • Full width\n  • Fixed height (change --mxabs-height)\n  • Thin scrollbar\n  • Great Vibes title centered\n  • No border / no radius\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Great+Vibes&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n<style>\n  :root{\n    --mxabs-height: 400px;     /* adjust if needed */\n    --mxabs-text: #1b1b1b;\n    --mxabs-bg:#fff;\n  }\n\n  .mxabs{width:100%; background:var(--mxabs-bg); padding:24px 0;}\n  .mxabs-wrap{width:100%; padding:0 clamp(14px, 2vw, 28px);}\n  .mxabs-title{\n    font-family:'Great Vibes', cursive !important;  /* enforce Great Vibes */\n    text-align:center;\n    font-size:clamp(30px, 5vw, 58px);\n    line-height:1;\n    margin:0 0 14px;\n  }\n  .mxabs-box{\n    height:var(--mxabs-height);\n    overflow:auto;\n    padding:22px 24px;\n    line-height:1.7;\n    font-size:16px;\n    color:var(--mxabs-text);\n    background:#fff;\n    border:none;          /* no border */\n    border-radius:0;      /* no radius */\n    box-shadow:none;\n  }\n  .mxabs-box p{margin:0 0 12px;}\n  .mxabs-box strong{font-weight:600;}\n\n  /* Thin scrollbars */\n  .mxabs-box::-webkit-scrollbar{width:6px;}\n  .mxabs-box::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:transparent;}\n  .mxabs-box::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:#bdbdbd; border-radius:8px;}\n  .mxabs-box:hover::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:#9b9b9b;}\n  .mxabs-box{scrollbar-width:thin; scrollbar-color:#bdbdbd transparent;}\n\n  @media (max-width: 768px){\n    .mxabs-box{font-size:15px; padding:18px;}\n  }\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"mxabs\" id=\"mxabs-hos\">\n  <div class=\"mxabs-wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"mxabs-title\">House of <span style=\"color:#FA05E8\">Sonali</span></h2>\n\n    <div class=\"mxabs-box\">\n      <p><strong>House of Sonali</strong> is a direct-to-consumer label celebrating the elegance of Indian sarees—crafted for the modern woman who loves timeless style and effortless comfort. We’re known for premium fabrics, thoughtful drapes, and designs that make you feel radiant, inside and out.</p>\n\n      <p><strong>Made in India</strong><br>\n      Our collections are designed and curated in India with meticulous attention to detail. Every piece goes through multiple quality checks so you receive exactly what you fell in love with online.</p>\n\n      <p><strong>Our Edits</strong><br>\n      <strong>Wedding Sarees</strong> – For your biggest moments. Discover statement weaves, rich embroideries, and flattering silhouettes made for the spotlight.<br>\n      <strong>Indian Traditional Sarees</strong> – Culture-first classics for festivals, pujas, and family celebrations—timeless designs that honor tradition.<br>\n      <strong>Party Wear Sarees</strong> – Shine at every soirée with fluid fabrics, contemporary palettes, and eye-catching details.<br>\n      <strong>Reception Sarees</strong> – Sophisticated, photo-ready looks to greet your loved ones in style.</p>\n\n      <p><strong>Silk Sarees</strong><br>\n      Silk needs no introduction. Our silk edit glows beautifully under light and elevates every color—from jewel tones to soft pastels.</p>\n\n      <p><strong>Bollywood-Inspired Styles</strong><br>\n      Love celeb looks? Explore sarees inspired by iconic on-screen moments—curated to be wearable, flattering, and ready for your next event.</p>\n\n      <p><strong>Everyday Essentials</strong><br>\n      Comfort meets elegance. Our daily-wear sarees are colorfast, easy-care, and made to last through countless washes and busy days.</p>\n\n      <p><strong>Fair, Transparent Pricing</strong><br>\n      As a D2C brand, we work directly with artisans and trusted partners—no middlemen—so you get premium quality at honest prices.</p>\n\n      <p><strong>Always Current</strong><br>\n      Fashion evolves fast. We drop fresh designs regularly so you never miss a trend. Tip: sort by “Newest” to browse the latest arrivals first.</p>\n\n      <p><strong>Color Stories</strong><br>\n      From serene blues to festive reds (and 30+ shades in between), explore prints, solids, and textured weaves designed to flatter every mood and moment.</p>\n\n      <p><strong>Worldwide Shipping</strong><br>\n      We ship globally with reliable partners. Whether you’re in the USA, UK, Canada, Australia, Europe, India, Mexico—or beyond—your House of Sonali piece is delivered safely to your doorstep.</p>\n\n      <p><strong>Returns &amp; Support</strong><br>\n      Please review our Returns &amp; Refunds policy for details. Have sizing, styling, or gifting questions? Our customer care team is here to help.</p>\n\n      <p><strong>More to Explore</strong><br>\n      Alongside sarees, discover our thoughtfully curated lehengas and salwar kameez—perfect companions for weddings, festivities, and special occasions.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
